flowchart TD
    User[Owner / Finder<br/>Streamlit UI] --> Intake[Intake<br/>pet attributes + opt-in location]
    User --> Photo[Photo upload]
    Photo --> Vision[Vision<br/>Roboflow Inference SDK<br/>live if API key, else DEMO fallback]
    Vision --> Verifier[Verifier<br/>human-in-the-loop<br/>confirm / correct attributes]
    Intake --> Verifier
    Verifier --> Retriever[Retriever / RAG-lite<br/>keyword retrieval over<br/>data/knowledge + profiles]
    Verifier --> Matcher[Matcher<br/>weighted score 0-100<br/>species gate + breed/colour/size/<br/>sex/markings/date/distance]
    Retriever --> Matcher
    Matcher --> Results[Ranked matches<br/>≥70 likely, 50-69 possible<br/>reasons + sources + fuzzed map]
    Results --> Notifier[Notifier<br/>draft contact message only<br/>nothing sent]
    Results --> Rewards[Rewards & Anonymous Hints<br/>pledge $0-$500, hints by case ID<br/>one eligible hint, claim code]
    Matcher --> Log[Logging + ai_interactions.md<br/>agent trace per run]
    Vision --> Log
    subgraph Guardrails
        G1[No definite identity claim]
        G2[Fuzzed location ~500m]
        G3[No contact details public]
        G4[No money moves in app]
    end
    Results --> Guardrails
    Rewards --> Guardrails
